sequenceDiagram
    participant G as GitHub CLI
    participant I as issue-intake.mjs
    participant P as Paseo CLI / host
    participant C as Coordinator
    I->>G: fetchIssues(config) → gh issue list
    G-->>I: Issue[] JSON
    Note over I: chooseIssue(input) → dispatch
    Note over I: writeAtomic(activeFile, intent)
    I->>P: call("paseo", argv)
    P->>C: 啟動 Agent Session
    P-->>I: raw JSON → agentId
    Note over C: SKILL.md / actions / references 為指令依賴
